  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your follow-up strikes leave your foes reeling.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Surprise Follow-Through<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Great Cleave, all opponents you hit are treated as flat-footed until the beginning of your next turn or until they are struck by an attack that requires an attack roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc186\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
